WEBVTT

00:10:26.818 --> 00:10:30.456
and makes the whole company
more productive.

00:10:32.048 --> 00:10:35.354
Preparedness, coalition-building,

00:10:35.378 --> 00:10:38.960
imagination, experiments,

00:10:38.984 --> 00:10:40.151
bravery --

00:10:41.028 --> 00:10:42.625
in an unpredictable age,

00:10:42.649 --> 00:10:48.317
these are tremendous sources
of resilience and strength.

00:10:48.673 --> 00:10:51.241
They aren't efficient,

00:10:52.278 --> 00:10:54.947
but they give us limitless capacity

00:10:54.971 --> 00:10:59.466
for adaptation, variation and invention.